WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:04.033
♪♪

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:05.567
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:09.267
The 64th annual Grammy Awards
were held last night,

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:12.367
and featured a pre-recorded
video from Ukrainian president

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:16.167
Volodomyr Zelenskyy, and I got
to say, as a 48-year-old man,

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:18.400
I was just happy to see someone
at the Grammys

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.934
whose name I knew.

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:23.734
[ Laughs ]

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:26.167
New York Mayor Eric Adams
on Saturday

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:28.667
visited the White House,
and that is the closest

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:32.934
any New York mayor has gotten
to the White House.

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:36.400
President Biden is set to host
former president Obama tomorrow

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.634
at the White House, and you know
Joe is excited.

00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:42.167
I'll bet he's turning the house
upside down right now,

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:44.534
looking for
the other controller.

00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:47.901
The House on Friday passed
a bill to legalize marijuana,

00:00:47.901 --> 00:00:51.501
largely along party lines,
then Don Jr. got excited

00:00:51.501 --> 00:00:53.367
because he thought
they had legalized

00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:57.767
party lines.

00:00:57.767 --> 00:00:59.934
The White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:02.267
is reportedly planning to leave
the Biden administration

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:04.033
in the next several weeks
to host a show

00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:06.234
on NBC's streaming platform,
Peacock.

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:09.634
Oh, God. Can I please be there
when you teach Joe

00:01:09.634 --> 00:01:12.033
how to download Peacock?

00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:19.534
"I need a Roku? Isn't that one
of those Japanese poems?

00:01:19.534 --> 00:01:21.834
The media company BuzzFeed,
over the weekend,

00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:23.267
shut down its news app.

00:01:23.267 --> 00:01:25.200
There were many reasons
for the move,

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:29.801
and number 7 will shock you.

00:01:29.801 --> 00:01:32.267
The Navy announced on Friday
it will name a ship

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:35.000
after the late Supreme Court
justice, Ruth Bader Ginsburg,

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.033
and this is cool --
Señor Frogs is naming

00:01:37.033 --> 00:01:42.467
their 64-ounce margarita
"The Kavanaugh."

00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:44.601
President Biden said last week
he believes

00:01:44.601 --> 00:01:48.000
Russian President Vladimir Putin
has placed some of top advisors

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.667
under house arrest.
Said Putin's oligarch advisors,

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:54.534
"Oh, no, not house arrest."

00:01:54.534 --> 00:01:57.868
And finally, Apple is reportedly
said to announce a new policy

00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:00.300
to deter thieves from trying
to steal --

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.834
excuse me, trying to sell
stolen iPhones --

00:02:02.834 --> 00:02:06.100
they're going to slap an Android
sticker on it.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:07.567
♪♪

00:02:07.567 --> 00:02:10.868
Former president Barack Obama
today visited the White House,

00:02:10.868 --> 00:02:14.701
and out of habit, Jeanine Pirro
called for his impeachment.

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:18.467
During a Zoom call last summer

00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:20.801
with a group
of presidential historians,

00:02:20.801 --> 00:02:24.334
former president Trump
reportedly imitated the accent

00:02:24.334 --> 00:02:26.267
of the president of South Korea.

00:02:26.267 --> 00:02:28.167
Alright, I'm not surprised

00:02:28.167 --> 00:02:30.467
he did something
horribly offensive.

00:02:30.467 --> 00:02:32.567
I am a little surprised
he did it

00:02:32.567 --> 00:02:36.400
on a call with
presidential historians.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.434
[ As Trump ] So, you guys
will be evaluating me

00:02:38.434 --> 00:02:39.601
for posterity, right?

00:02:39.601 --> 00:02:41.167
Okay.

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:44.634
Then you're gonna love this.
Two lesbians walk into a bar.

00:02:44.634 --> 00:02:46.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.534 --> 00:02:48.601
[ Normal voice ]
President Biden said yesterday

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.701
that Russian president
Vladimir Putin

00:02:50.701 --> 00:02:52.334
should face a war crimes trial

00:02:52.334 --> 00:02:54.300
for his recent actions
in Ukraine.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:57.300
Good luck to whoever pulls that
in jury duty.

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.367 --> 00:02:59.601
"Is there any reason

00:02:59.601 --> 00:03:01.801
why you shouldn't be selected
for this case?"

00:03:01.801 --> 00:03:04.634
"Um, I got a wife and kids."

00:03:04.634 --> 00:03:07.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.634
The Senate Judiciary
Committee's vote

00:03:09.634 --> 00:03:12.734
to move Ketanji Brown Jackson's
nomination out of committee

00:03:12.734 --> 00:03:16.367
was delayed yesterday because
California senator Alex Padilla

00:03:16.367 --> 00:03:18.267
was forced to switch
to a later flight.

00:03:18.267 --> 00:03:21.100
Look, I don't care if the fate
of the Supreme Court

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.400
hangs in the balance.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:25.834
They offer you $400 in
flight credits, you take it.

00:03:25.834 --> 00:03:27.567
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:29.467
Probably a food voucher.

00:03:29.467 --> 00:03:32.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.367
An environmental group
said in a new report

00:03:34.367 --> 00:03:37.300
that it cleaned up nearly
half a million pieces of trash

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:38.968
last year
from New Jersey beaches,

00:03:38.968 --> 00:03:41.000
including a fake eyeball.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.934
Wow.
I am shocked.

00:03:43.934 --> 00:03:45.334
That it was fake.

00:03:45.334 --> 00:03:48.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.334 --> 00:03:50.868
I mean, I feel like most days
you go to the Jersey Shore,

00:03:50.868 --> 00:03:52.300
you're seeing a real eyeball.

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:55.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.701 --> 00:03:57.667
The environmental group
also reported

00:03:57.667 --> 00:04:01.234
finding male enhancement pills
and a glow-in-the-dark condom,

00:04:01.234 --> 00:04:04.367
or as it's known in New Jersey,
solid Tuesday night.

00:04:04.367 --> 00:04:07.968
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.968 --> 00:04:11.200
According to a new study,
regular Fox News viewers

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:13.400
who were paid to watch CNN
for 30 days

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:16.868
became more skeptical and less
likely to believe fake news.

00:04:16.868 --> 00:04:18.868
Said one participant,
"Before this,

00:04:18.868 --> 00:04:22.167
I didn't even know some women
had brown hair."

00:04:22.167 --> 00:04:25.067
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.067 --> 00:04:27.033
Crazy.

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:28.934
According to the latest numbers,

00:04:28.934 --> 00:04:31.701
the average price for a slice
of pizza in New York City

00:04:31.701 --> 00:04:34.100
is now more expensive
than riding the subway.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:36.067
And for both things,
it's a good idea

00:04:36.067 --> 00:04:38.901
to soak up the grease
with a napkin first.

00:04:38.901 --> 00:04:41.601
[ Laughter, groaning ]

00:04:41.601 --> 00:04:44.400
I mean, I don't --
I don't quite know what we're --

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.968
what we want from the audience
when we tell a joke like that.

00:04:46.968 --> 00:04:48.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.601 --> 00:04:52.767
That was a very fair and
accurate response by all of you.

00:04:52.767 --> 00:04:56.334
Every now and then, we like
to set the levels, you know.

00:04:56.334 --> 00:04:59.601
We don't say a joke so much
as just a truly disgusting idea.

00:04:59.601 --> 00:05:01.834
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.267 --> 00:05:05.734
According to a new survey,
16% of Americans

00:05:05.734 --> 00:05:08.133
live in the same city or town
that they grew up in.

00:05:08.133 --> 00:05:11.033
The other 84% have them muted
on Facebook.

00:05:11.033 --> 00:05:13.467
[ Laughter ]

00:05:13.467 --> 00:05:16.667
In anticipation
of legal marijuana

00:05:16.667 --> 00:05:18.367
being available later this year,

00:05:18.367 --> 00:05:20.601
New York governor Kathy Hochul
yesterday

00:05:20.601 --> 00:05:23.367
unveiled the state's
Cannabis Conversations campaign,

00:05:23.367 --> 00:05:26.267
which I'm guessing is that thing
where the edible kicks in

00:05:26.267 --> 00:05:28.334
and you end up
debating your cat.

00:05:28.334 --> 00:05:31.701
[ Laughter ]

00:05:31.701 --> 00:05:33.601
"I think you're hard
to be around."

00:05:33.601 --> 00:05:35.901
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.334 --> 00:05:47.467
"Okay."

00:05:47.467 --> 00:05:49.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:50.901
The "New York Post"
recently reported

00:05:50.901 --> 00:05:53.868
that at least 139 people
around the country

00:05:53.868 --> 00:05:55.267
have said they became sick

00:05:55.267 --> 00:05:57.801
after eating the breakfast
cereal Lucky Charms,

00:05:57.801 --> 00:06:00.334
or as they're now known,
just Charms.

00:06:00.334 --> 00:06:02.868
[ Laughter ]

00:06:02.868 --> 00:06:04.167
A restaurant in Florida

00:06:04.167 --> 00:06:06.501
reportedly canceled
a dinner reservation recently

00:06:06.501 --> 00:06:09.133
after discovering the gathering
was a going-away party

00:06:09.133 --> 00:06:11.334
for a Capitol rioter
who was sentenced to prison.

00:06:11.334 --> 00:06:14.868
Alright, but don't be shocked
if they show up anyway.

00:06:14.868 --> 00:06:16.968
[ Laughter ]

00:06:18.767 --> 00:06:21.901
And finally, authorities
in Florida announced yesterday

00:06:21.901 --> 00:06:23.367
that they arrested six men

00:06:23.367 --> 00:06:26.400
who allegedly stole thousands
of dollars' worth of gasoline

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:27.801
from several gas stations.

00:06:27.801 --> 00:06:30.968
They would have gotten away, but
thousands of dollars of gasoline

00:06:30.968 --> 00:06:34.467
was still only
like a quarter tank.

00:06:34.467 --> 00:06:35.634
♪♪

00:06:35.634 --> 00:06:36.901
During an event yesterday,

00:06:36.901 --> 00:06:38.634
celebrating
the Affordable Care Act,

00:06:38.634 --> 00:06:41.601
President Biden welcomed
former president Barack Obama

00:06:41.601 --> 00:06:43.267
back to the White House
and said,

00:06:43.267 --> 00:06:45.200
"Feels like the good ol' days."

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.033
Yeah, I'll be it does.

00:06:47.033 --> 00:06:49.701
The good ol' days when you were
just going out for ice cream

00:06:49.701 --> 00:06:53.467
and riding shotgun on the
Hope and Change Express.

00:06:53.467 --> 00:06:57.033
Sucks when the responsibility
is all yours, doesn't it?

00:06:57.033 --> 00:06:58.934
Turns out,
there's a world of difference

00:06:58.934 --> 00:07:01.934
between taking an Uber
and driving an Uber.

00:07:01.934 --> 00:07:03.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:03.234 --> 00:07:05.667
President Biden
is set to sign a bill today

00:07:05.667 --> 00:07:08.934
that will increase the financial
stability and reliability

00:07:08.934 --> 00:07:10.234
of the US Postal Service.

00:07:10.234 --> 00:07:15.834
The bill is called the
Pottery Barn Act of 2022.

00:07:15.834 --> 00:07:17.734
Ivanka Trump reportedly
met yesterday

00:07:17.734 --> 00:07:18.934
with the House committee

00:07:18.934 --> 00:07:21.033
investigating the January
attack on the Capitol

00:07:21.033 --> 00:07:22.200
for nearly 8 hours.

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:24.067
Oh, my God, you guys.
She did it!

00:07:24.067 --> 00:07:26.901
She worked an 8-hour day!

00:07:26.901 --> 00:07:28.901
[ Laughter ]

00:07:28.901 --> 00:07:30.734
I knew she could!
I knew she could.

00:07:30.734 --> 00:07:33.734
A man on a Southwest Airlines
flight was arrested

00:07:33.734 --> 00:07:35.868
over the weekend
after he was allegedly

00:07:35.868 --> 00:07:37.300
caught masturbating on board.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:40.167
He was caught after passengers
heard clapping

00:07:40.167 --> 00:07:42.100
before the plane landed.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.801
[ Laughter ]

00:07:47.434 --> 00:07:49.000
According to the latest numbers,

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.367
the second season of
the Netflix series "Bridgerton"

00:07:51.367 --> 00:07:55.300
was watched for more than
250 million hours

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.701
over the last week,
which is a record

00:07:56.701 --> 00:07:58.767
for the most-viewed
English language show,

00:07:58.767 --> 00:08:01.200
even though most people
watched it on mute.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:03.234
[ Laughter ]

00:08:03.234 --> 00:08:06.734
And finally, today was
National Walking Day.

00:08:06.734 --> 00:08:09.934
This news first reported
by a sign in the subway.

00:08:09.934 --> 00:08:11.367
♪♪

00:08:11.367 --> 00:08:14.200
Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson
today became the first

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.534
Black woman to be confirmed
to the Supreme Court,

00:08:16.534 --> 00:08:17.934
in case you're wondering

00:08:17.934 --> 00:08:21.100
why the flag over the Fox News
building is at half staff.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.534
[ Laughter ]

00:08:22.534 --> 00:08:24.801
That's right,
Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson

00:08:24.801 --> 00:08:27.300
today became the first
Black woman to be confirmed

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:28.634
to the Supreme Court.

00:08:28.634 --> 00:08:30.467
And I can't believe
I have to say this --

00:08:30.467 --> 00:08:33.968
Brett, that champagne
was for everyone.

00:08:33.968 --> 00:08:37.100
[ Laughter ]

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.934
In a speech
at a union conference,

00:08:38.934 --> 00:08:41.000
President Biden joked that
he had forgotten the name

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.167
of former President Trump
and said,

00:08:43.167 --> 00:08:45.501
"That last guy, what was
his name, anyway?

00:08:45.501 --> 00:08:47.501
He never showed up
in the inauguration.

00:08:47.501 --> 00:08:51.167
Though, to be fair, it's not
like we showed up to his."

00:08:51.167 --> 00:08:53.634
[ Laughter ]

00:08:53.634 --> 00:08:56.067
Former President Trump yesterday
officially endorsed

00:08:56.067 --> 00:08:58.200
Georgia Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.868
for re-election and said she is

00:08:59.868 --> 00:09:02.934
"a warrior who doesn't back down
and doesn't give up."

00:09:02.934 --> 00:09:04.934
Basically, all the same reasons

00:09:04.934 --> 00:09:06.934
she's banned from Target.

00:09:06.934 --> 00:09:08.901
[ Laughter ]

00:09:08.901 --> 00:09:10.901
NBC News staffers
are reportedly worried

00:09:10.901 --> 00:09:12.334
that the company's decision
to hire

00:09:12.334 --> 00:09:14.701
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki

00:09:14.701 --> 00:09:18.367
to host a show on MSNBC could
taint the network's credibility.

00:09:18.367 --> 00:09:19.701
Meanwhile, Fox News

00:09:19.701 --> 00:09:21.667
is almost entirely taints.

00:09:21.667 --> 00:09:23.534
[ Laughter ]

00:09:23.534 --> 00:09:25.200
According to a new survey,

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:27.300
Ukrainian President
Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:30.467
is the world's most popular
leader among Americans.

00:09:30.467 --> 00:09:32.634
But, remember, Volodymyr,
two weeks ago,

00:09:32.634 --> 00:09:35.300
Will Smith was our most popular
movie star.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:38.634
[ Laughter ]

00:09:38.634 --> 00:09:41.968
Pinterest announced yesterday
that it will prohibit users

00:09:41.968 --> 00:09:44.801
from sharing climate
misinformation on the platform,

00:09:44.801 --> 00:09:47.300
forcing them to move to Etsy.

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:48.834
[ Laughter ]

00:09:51.901 --> 00:09:54.067
And, finally,
NASA announced this week

00:09:54.067 --> 00:09:58.000
that an asteroid the size
of a small house flew by Earth.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.334
And this is crazy --

00:09:59.334 --> 00:10:02.234
it got three offers on Zillow.

00:10:02.234 --> 00:10:04.033
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:10:04.033 --> 00:10:10.133
♪♪

